<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst Harry Ikenson said he raised his rating on Intimate Brands Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>--Ikenson said &quot;the company has now beat consensus EPS expectations for two consecutive quarters, which gives us renewed confidence in a more consistent performance.&quot;</p>
<p>Shares in the owner of Victoria's Secret and Bath &amp; Body Works were unchanged at 20-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
